# Rebecca Nicholson — personal site

Built from your original "freelancer-portfolio-template" (FreeFolio /
HTML Codex), restyled with your real content and a separate blog
section. The colors, fonts, and hero/section styling are all the
original template's own `css/style.css` — untouched — so this matches
what you originally had, not a guess at it.

## Structure

```
index.html          Landing page (single scrollable page)
css/style.css        Original template stylesheet — untouched, all your colors/fonts
css/blog.css         Small addition for the blog's left-nav layout (uses the same --primary green)
img/                 Images — includes your real hero photo (RN Photo.png)
js/main.js           Trimmed template JS (kept: nav scroll, typed tagline, back-to-top;
                     removed: video modal, skill bars, portfolio filter, testimonial carousel —
                     since those sections were replaced, see "What changed" below)
lib/                 Typed.js + easing (used by the tagline and smooth-scroll)
blog/                Generated — do not edit these files directly
  index.html
  posts/*.html
blog_src/            Source files for the blog — edit these
  posts/*.md          One Markdown file per post
  build_blog.py       Regenerates blog/ from posts/*.md
  template_post.html  Layout template for a single post
  template_index.html Layout template for the blog listing page
```

